 te-a-bruxelles/
DESCRIPTION:Brusselbad: A Deep Dive into Social Issues and Health in Brus
 sels The Brussels social landscape is complex\, with extensive services 
 in Dutch\, French\, and bilingual offerings. The super-diversity of Brus
 sels residents\, precarious situations\, and multiple challenges inheren
 t to a major city and reception city present a true challenge. This is w
 hy the Kenniscentrum Welzijn\, Wonen\, Zorg is organizing Brusselbad\, a
  three-day training program for social and health professionals in Bruss
 els. The next session will take place on October 8 and 29 (9-14\nhttps:/
 /cbcs.be/event/brusselbad-une-plongee-dans-le-social-et-la-sante-a-bruxe
 lles/
