UID:985456d01a6fe5c4@neighbourhood-events
DTSTAMP:20261001T172640Z
DTSTART:20261127T190000Z
DTEND:20261127T210000Z
SUMMARY:The Living Souls of the Great Egrets
LOCATION:Maison poème\, Rue d'Écosse 30\, 1060 Saint-Gilles
URL:https://maisonpoeme.be/
DESCRIPTION:Diaty Diallo brings voice and music to an article written for
  the magazine La Déferlante. She tells the story of an abandoned neighb
 orhood where memories and hopes blend with harsh reality. Drawing inspir
